  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Greeting**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Banter - Nate**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Bound to Ride**: rare: 12 archived performances [3]\n- **Banter - Opt Out of Set Break**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **John Henry**: back after 165 archived shows (1106 days); rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **Randall Collins - (Norman Blake cover) (**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **) Haul de Woodpile Down - (Sam Patterson Trio cover)**: rare: 3 archived performances [3]\n- **Banter - Did You See That Pick?**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2022-07-30.16-44_Schoeps_MK41v** (recommended): source not stated; 35 songs; 148 min [1]\n- **billystrings2022-07-30.mk4.bsc2.flac16**: source not stated; 29 songs; 150 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Taper was allowed to set up behind other attendees' seats; the venue permits taping [1]\n- Set two's break featured Billy playing a solo spot [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2022-07-30.16-44_Schoeps_MK41v**: taped by Mott77; transferred by Mott77; source: Schoeps MK41v > nBobs > PFAs > Sound Devices MixPre6 II (32F-48) [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK41 microphones, placed about ten feet high in the front-of-board area [1]\n- **billystrings2022-07-30.mk4.bsc2.flac16**: taped by Adam Huston; transferred by Adam Huston; source: MK4 + BSC2/K31 > Sound Devices MixPre 6 II [2]. Also: Chain: Schoeps MK4 and Busman BSC2/K31 mics into a Sound Devices MixPre II recorder; Transfer went from SD card to PC, through Audacity and CD Wave, then to TLH; Adam Huston taped and uploaded it [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings TCU Amphitheater at White River State Park - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/tcu-amphitheater-at-white-river-state-park/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings TCU Amphitheater at White River State Park - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/tcu-amphitheater-at-white-river-state-park/) [5]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings TCU Amphitheater at White River State Park - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/venue/tcu-amphitheater-at-white-river-state-park/) [6]",
